1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,300
广东人消暑，不靠冰
Canton doesn't beat the heat with ice.

2
00:00:02,400 --> 00:00:04,700
靠一碗煮到"起沙"的绿豆
But a bowl of "sandy" mung beans.

3
00:00:04,800 --> 00:00:07,100
慢火两小时，煮到豆子起沙
Two hours low heat, until sandy.

4
00:00:07,200 --> 00:00:09,500
淀粉全出来，绵密不见豆
Starch out — smooth, no whole beans.

5
00:00:09,600 --> 00:00:11,900
广东做法，还要加三样
The Canton way adds three things.

6
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:14,300
陈皮：中和绿豆的寒
Aged peel — to soften the chill.

7
00:00:14,400 --> 00:00:16,700
海带：多添一层口感
Kelp — for one more layer of bite.

8
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:19,100
老吃客，还加一把臭草
Old-timers toss in a sprig of rue.

9
00:00:19,200 --> 00:00:21,500
一碗下肚，暑气就散了
One bowl, and the heat lifts.

10
00:00:21,600 --> 00:00:24,300
从冰室到糖水铺，三年破600亿
Cha chaan teng to shops — a 60-billion boom.

11
00:00:24,400 --> 00:00:26,700
消暑，还是那碗起沙的绿豆
Still that sandy mung bean bowl.

12
00:00:26,800 --> 00:00:29,200
四碗糖水，你最想吃哪碗？
Four sweet soups — which one's yours?

13
00:00:29,300 --> 00:00:31,600
广东糖水四部曲，完
Canton Sweet Soups — series complete.
